{"id": "71919", "title": "月欢", "author": "黎夜123456", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 9, "available": 9, "cover": "files/article/image/71/71919/71919s.jpg", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/71/71919.htm", "intro": "月欢，温暖，坚强又倔强的女人，\n    如黑暗中沈静的月光，\n    深深的吸引著生活在黑暗中的生物，\n    被包容，被原谅，淡淡的温暖，不炙热，却暖暖的，让人为之疯狂。\n    PS：挺好看的，有那啥，乃懂得~~", "base": "files/article/html/71/71919", "chapters": [{"title": "正文", "volume": true}, {"title": "1-10", "file": "11319440.html", "available": true}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "11319441.html", "available": true}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "11319442.html", "available": true}, {"title": "31-40", "file": "11319443.html", "available": true}, {"title": "41-50", "file": "11319444.html", "available": true}, {"title": "51-60", "file": "11319445.html", "available": true}, {"title": "61-70", "file": "11319446.html", "available": true}, {"title": "71-80", "file": "11319447.html", "available": true}, {"title": "81-90完结", "file": "11319448.html", "available": true}]}